# Use writes of `x` and `y`: a number, a text or a list, and the body tells them apart. Nothing leans on that whole word, so each went back to what one test tells, the list alone: a guard that let
# lists through and sent every number, which the word itself says may come and which most calls hand over, to the slow version. Where nothing leans on the whole word a list written from use is no word
